@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class

RECTANGLE "User" as user
RECTANGLE "CLI Parser" as cli_parser
RECTANGLE "Input Handler" as input_handler
RECTANGLE "ECDLP Solver Engine" as solver_engine
RECTANGLE "Work File Manager" as work_file_manager
RECTANGLE "Distributed Server" as dist_server
RECTANGLE "Distributed Client" as dist_client
RECTANGLE "Offline Merger" as offline_merger
RECTANGLE "GPU Accelerator" as gpu_accelerator

user --> cli_parser : invokes
cli_parser --> input_handler : parses args\nroutes commands
input_handler --> solver_engine : configures
input_handler --> work_file_manager : manages files
work_file_manager --> solver_engine : loads/stores state
solver_engine --> gpu_accelerator : offloads computation
dist_client --> dist_server : connects & computes
dist_server --> work_file_manager : outputs work files
offline_merger --> work_file_manager : reads work files
offline_merger <-- work_file_manager : merges states

note right of solver_engine
  Pollard's Kangaroo Algorithm
  Tame and Wild Herds
  Distinguished Points Method
end note

note right of dist_server
  No Authentication
  Manual Network Management Required
end note

note right of work_file_manager
  Supports Resume
  Supports Merge
  Stores Kangaroo State
end note

note right of offline_merger
  Combines Work Files
  Detects Solutions
end note

note bottom of gpu_accelerator
  Optional GPU Support
end note

@enduml
